{"parse": {"title": "Dungeons", "pageid": 1584, "revid": 37260, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Cursed_Parade\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Cursed Parade</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Cursed_Womb\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Cursed Womb</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"The_Fire\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">The Fire</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Anniversary_Island\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Anniversary Island</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 268px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3d/Cursed_Parade.png/revision/latest?cb=20221102082814\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Are you the strongest because you&#39;re Satoru Gojo? Or are you Satoru Gojo because you&#39;re the strongest?&quot;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3d/Cursed_Parade.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221102082814\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"268\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Parade.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Parade.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Cursed_Parade.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>\"Are you the strongest because you're Satoru Gojo? Or are you Satoru Gojo because you're the strongest?\"</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cursed_Parade\"><span style=\"font-size: 200%;\">Cursed Parade</span></span></h3>\n<p>Introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_6.5_-_Jujutsu_Kaisen_Update_Part_2\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 6: Part 2</a>, <b>Cursed Parade</b> is a challenging dungeon where you and up to 6 others have to protect the academy from the sudden surge of curses. Will you be able to exorcise them?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This dungeon does not hold back, so make sure to bring heavy damage dealers and air support!</li></ul>\n<ul><li>On wave 20, your final challenge is to defeat the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Getu (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2V0dT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Getu Boss</span>!</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Keys\">Keys</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Key (Cursed Parade): <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">200 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">200 Gems</span></span></a> or <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\">2000 Gold</span></a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Gives you the normal amount of rewards</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Shiny Key (Cursed Parade): <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Robux\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Robux.png\" data-image-key=\"Robux.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221030053917\" /></a></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(#F7F7FE, #939397); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">99 Robux</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Doubles the chance of getting a <span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> unit</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Drop\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Getu.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Getu.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Getu.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Getu</div></dd>\n</td>\n<td>1% (2% with shiny key) (No longer obtainable)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x4-10 <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Cursed Orb\"><img alt=\"Cursed Orb\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Orb.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Orb.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/db/Cursed_Orb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230115012318\" /></span></span> <span class=\"dottedText\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evolution\" title=\"Evolution\">Cursed Orb</a></span></span><br /></span>\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 248px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/74/Cursed_Womb.png/revision/latest?cb=20221102095244\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Throughout heaven and earth, he alone is the honored one\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"248\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Womb.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Womb.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/74/Cursed_Womb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/248?cb=20221102095244\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/74/Cursed_Womb.png/revision/latest?cb=20221102095244\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Throughout heaven and earth, he alone is the honored one\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/74/Cursed_Womb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/248?cb=20221102095244\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"248\" height=\"300\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Womb.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Womb.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/74/Cursed_Womb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/248?cb=20221102095244\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Cursed_Womb.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>\"Throughout heaven and earth, he alone is the honored one.\"</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cursed_Womb\"><span style=\"font-size: 200%;\">Cursed Womb</span></span></h3>\n<p>Introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_6.5_-_Jujutsu_Kaisen_Update_Part_2\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 6: Part 2</a>, <b>Cursed Womb</b> is a dungeon that hides the remains of a very powerful curse; the strongest even. What lengths are you willing to go to retrieve these remains?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This dungeon is not the hardest, but it's never good to be cocky. Make sure to bring a buddy!</li></ul>\n<ul><li>On wave 15, defeating the Finger Bearer boss will reward you with one of the strongest curses' lost finger</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirement\">Requirement</span></h2>\n<p>To enter the dungeon, you must defeat a Womb Curse in <b>Cursed Academy</b> infinite and obtain their key\n</p>\n<ul><li>x1 Key (Cursed Womb)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul><li>x1 <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"material-tooltip\" data-param=\"Cursed Finger\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Cursed Finger\"><img alt=\"Cursed Finger\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cursed Finger.png\" data-image-key=\"Cursed_Finger.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9a/Cursed_Finger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20250323070916\" /></span></span> <span class=\"dottedText\"><a href=\"/wiki/Items#Materials\" title=\"Items\">Cursed Finger</a></span></span><br /></span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Fire\"><span style=\"font-size: 200%;\">The Fire</span></span></h3>\n<p>Introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_7.6_-_Karakora_Town_Update_Part_2_-_2_December_2022\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 7.6: Part 2</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Drop\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Yamomoto.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Yamomoto.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Yamomoto.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Yamomoto</div></dd>\n</td>\n<td>5% (No longer obtainable)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x??? <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/09/Worthy_Soul.png/revision/latest?cb=20230123040324\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Worthy Soul\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/09/Worthy_Soul.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230123040324\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Worthy Soul.png\" data-image-key=\"Worthy_Soul.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>Worthy Soul<br /></span>\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anniversary_Island\"><span style=\"font-size: 200%;\">Anniversary Island</span></span></h3>\n<p>Introduced in <span class=\"new\" title=\"1st Anniversary Update (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMXN0X0Fubml2ZXJzYXJ5X1VwZGF0ZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">1st Anniversary Update</span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Drop\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/03/Anniversary_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20230714183144\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Anniversary Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/03/Anniversary_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230714183144\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Anniversary Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Anniversary_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>Anniversary Star<br /></span>\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/36/Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png/revision/latest?cb=20250104040756\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Anniversary Starry Ball\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/36/Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250104040756\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Anniversary Starry Ball.png\" data-image-key=\"Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>Anniversary Starry Ball<br /></span>\n</td>\n<td>100% (one times a day MAX, 24 hour cooldown)\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261020094036\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.137 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.159 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 325/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4543/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 269/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 12341/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.066/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 7153650/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  141.311      1 -total\n 61.37%   86.718      2 Template:Characterbox\n 13.51%   19.086      5 Template:Item\n  6.66%    9.416      1 Template:Robux\n  1.10%    1.553      1 Template:Rarity\n  1.06%    1.497      1 Template:Gems\n  0.82%    1.161      1 Template:Gold\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:1584-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261020094036 and revision id 37260. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Cursed_Parade.png", "Gems.png", "Gold.png", "Robux.png", "Getu.png", "Cursed_Orb.png", "Cursed_Womb.png", "Cursed_Finger.png", "Yamomoto.png", "Worthy_Soul.png", "Anniversary_Star.png", "Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png"], "sections": [], "showto